Planex counter_4abs — minimal 4-abstraction demo
================================================
Validates: Relation + Estimate + Closure + Perception

Setup:
  Estimate: count = 0
  Closures: inc, dec (5-stage, no perception param)
  Relations: inc TRIGGERS count, dec TRIGGERS count
  Perceptions: 2 registered

Interaction: trigger inc 3 times, dec once

Denotations after interactions:
  [text perception]    Counter: 2
  [a11y perception]    Counter value is 2

Validation:
  Final count: 2 (expected: 2)
  Perceptions registered: 2 (expected: 2)
  Closure inc last evaluated: true

=== Demo complete ===

What this demo shows:
  1. Estimate (count) — state with value + confidence
  2. Closure (inc, dec) — 5-stage execution, no perception param
  3. Relation (TRIGGERS) — inc/dec causally trigger count
  4. Perception (text, a11y) — pure functions denoting count

Key post-ADR-0005 patterns:
  - Closure signature is 5-arg (no perception parameter)
  - Render is NOT a Closure (was PX_INTENT_EXPRESS before)
  - Multiple perceptions coexist for the same Estimate
  - Perceptions are pure functions (testable, cacheable)
